### Get all cats
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats

### Get cat by ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### Add a new cat
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cat_name": "Peo",
  "birthdate": "2021-08-20",
  "weight": 5.2,
  "owner": "Minä",
  "image": "https://loremflickr.com/320/240/cat"
}

### Update a cat
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Kissa"
}

### Delete a cat
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/1

